{"path":"io/basic_osyncstream/operator=","title":"std::basic_osyncstream<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_osyncstream&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream/operator=","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Move-assigns a synchronized output stream:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_osyncstream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream\"><span class=\"kw2665\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_osyncstream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Move-assigns a synchronized output stream:\n</p><p>Move-assigns the wrapped <span class=\"t-lc\">std::basic_syncbuf</span> from the corresponding member of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> (after this move-assignment, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other.<span class=\"me1\">get_wrapped</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> returns a null pointer and destruction of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> produces no output; any pending buffered output will be emitted) and <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/operator=\">move-assigns</a> the base <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> (this swaps all stream state variables except for <code>rdbuf</code> between <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another synchronized output stream to move from\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;syncstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;utility&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream\"><span class=\"kw2667\">std::<span class=\"me2\">osyncstream</span></span></a> out<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"test<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostringstream\"><span class=\"kw1753\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostringstream</span></span></a> str_out<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream\"><span class=\"kw2667\">std::<span class=\"me2\">osyncstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span>str_out<span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>out<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Note that out is emitted here</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"str_out = \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/quoted\"><span class=\"kw1819\">std::<span class=\"me2\">quoted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>str_out.<span class=\"me1\">view</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>test\nstr_out = \"\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3867\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3867</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>the move assignment operator was <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span></span>, but<br><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf\"><code>std::basic_syncbuf</code></a>'s move assignment operator is not\n</td>\n<td>removed <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span></span>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream/basic_osyncstream\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a <code>basic_osyncstream</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream/~basic_osyncstream\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destroys the <code>basic_osyncstream</code> and emits its internal buffer <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream/emit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>emit</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  calls <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf/emit\"><code>emit()</code></a> on the underlying <code>basic_syncbuf</code> to transmit its internal data to the final destination <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_osyncstream","title":"std::basic_osyncstream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_osyncstream<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Move-assigns a synchronized output stream:"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a basic_osyncstream object"},{"label":"(destructor)","note":"destroys the basic_osyncstream and emits its internal buffer"},{"label":"emit","note":"calls emit() on the underlying basic_syncbuf to transmit its internal data to the final destination"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":202,"codeBlockCount":2}
